DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_D71D_CB8E';
<p>d71d_cb8e</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #845011;">Gene D</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #845011;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #845011;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene P</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #116b6c;"><i>prickly</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #116b6c;">Gene P</span> is covered with sharp bristles, giving it a spiky texture.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene X</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #524bbd;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #524bbd;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, prickly, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,732</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">39,607</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,462</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe5cf; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,356</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">1,446</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">prickly</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #c9f4f4; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">p</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,324</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e9e7ff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">39,369</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #845011;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #116b6c;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #524bbd;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,704</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">140,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>X</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>D</b> and <b>X</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_D71D_CB8E
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(1,356 + 1,446 + 5,704 + 23,324)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>31,830</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.2274 = <strong>22.74 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(1,356 + 1,446 + 5,704 + 39,369)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>47,875</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.3420 = <strong>34.20 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(1,356 + 1,446 + 5,704 + 5,732)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>14,238</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.1017 = <strong>10.17 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(1,446 + 5,732 + 23,462 + 39,607)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>70,247</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.5018 = <strong>50.18 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(39,369 + 39,607)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>78,976</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.5641 = <strong>56.41 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(5,704 + 5,732 + 23,324 + 23,462)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>58,222</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.4159 = <strong>41.59 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(5,704 + 5,732 + 23,324 + 23,462)</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = <sup>58,222</sup>/<sub>140,000</sub> = 0.4159 = <strong>41.59 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D71D_CB8E_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
